+            // - screen-sized and textured (images, the title vignette), or screen-sized in one colour (fades): yes;
+            // - screen-sized with a colour gradient and no texture: no, a decorative overlay over gameplay (the mines' tint);
+            // - far larger than the screen and untextured (iris wipes): yes;
+            // - far larger than the screen and textured: no, a glow sprite close to the camera (the mines' lamps).
